{"3716530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scare: Fatal Picture - The Other Side", "steam_appid": 3716530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tScare: Fatal Picture – The Other Side is a psychological horror game in which you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tmust take pictures of ghosts to destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scare: Fatal Picture - The Other Side is a psychological horror game where you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play as Saori, a young woman trapped in a ghostly prison to be eaten by the Ghost Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a camera, you must take pictures of ghosts to destroy them. Every photo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >taken can make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn ghostly points by taking pictures of ghosts and use them to upgrade your camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all ghosts are enemies. some will work with you in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing a chapter, test your memory by answering story questions to unlock the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >next chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your camera to destroy ghosts by taking pictures of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect ghostly points by taking pictures to upgrade your camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience a deep narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock chapters by answering story questions that test your memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immerse yourself in a horror atmosphere inspired by japanese ghost stories</p>", "about_the_game": "<p